{
  "name": "turn-steer-unapplied",
  "about": "没被取出的插话单独比（src/agent/turn/TurnRunner.ts:158-173 closeSteerMailbox）：maxTurns=1，模型调 bash sleep 2，sleep 期间（tool_call_started 时）插话；工具批之后的 maxTurns 检查（src/agent/loop/AgentLoop.ts:2211-2230）先于下一次请求前取插话，轮次以 max_turns 结束，插话一直没被取出，作为 steer_unapplied（reason turn_ended）发出。原来是 turn-steer-terminal 的 s2，拆出来是为了不受 s1 那处落盘次序差异的牵连。",
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\":\"Steer end\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "s2",
      "when": [
        "st-2:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_st2",
          "name": "bash",
          "arguments": {
            "command": "sleep 2; echo slept",
            "description": "sleep"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "ws": "set_permission_mode",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-st-2",
        "mode": "bypassPermissions"
      }
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-st-2",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "runId": "run-st-2",
        "message": "st-2: answer",
        "maxTurns": 1
      },
      "answer": [
        {
          "on": {
            "type": "tool_call_started"
          },
          "ws": "steer_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "s-st-2",
            "runId": "run-st-2",
            "itemId": "item-2",
            "message": "steer-2: never applied"
          },
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
    },
    {
      "ws": "read_session_messages",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-st-2"
      }
    }
  ]
}
